    <item>
      <title>Como Publicar Sua Biblioteca Go no Pkg Go</title>
      <link>https://gilsoares.dev/blog/pt/posts/how-to-publish-your-go-library-on-pkg-go/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 31 Oct 2024 14:38:09 -0300</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://gilsoares.dev/blog/pt/posts/how-to-publish-your-go-library-on-pkg-go/</guid>
      
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Continuando minha jornada para aprender Go com profundidade, hoje vou mostrar como publicar sua biblioteca no &lt;a href=&#34;https://pkg.go.dev/&#34;&gt;Pkg.Go&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Antes de tudo, você precisa ter uma biblioteca Go na sua conta do GitHub ou em qualquer outro repositório Git.
Neste exemplo, vou usar uma biblioteca simples que criei, para mostrar como publicá-la.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A biblioteca é a &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/linuxsoares/valid-brazilian-cnpj&#34;&gt;valid-brazilian-cnpj&lt;/a&gt;.
No Brasil temos um documento chamado CNPJ, e no ano que vem as regras de validação vão mudar,
então criei esta biblioteca para me ajudar a validar CNPJs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Como criei a biblioteca não é o foco deste post, mas, se quiser ver o código, é só acessar o repositório.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Para publicar sua biblioteca no Pkg.Go, você precisa criar uma release no seu repositório.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;primeiro-passo-rode-go-mod-tidy&#34;&gt;Primeiro passo: rode go mod tidy&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O primeiro passo é rodar &lt;code&gt;go mod tidy&lt;/code&gt; para garantir que todas as dependências estejam no arquivo &lt;code&gt;go.mod&lt;/code&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;go mod tidy
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h1 id=&#34;segundo-passo-rode-os-testes&#34;&gt;Segundo passo: rode os testes&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O segundo passo é rodar os testes para garantir que tudo funciona como esperado.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;go &lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;test&lt;/span&gt; -v
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Esse comando roda todos os testes da biblioteca e mostra os resultados.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;terceiro-passo-crie-uma-tag&#34;&gt;Terceiro passo: crie uma tag&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O terceiro passo é criar uma tag no seu repositório.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;git tag v0.1.0
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;git push origin v0.1.0
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Esses comandos criam uma tag chamada &lt;code&gt;v0.1.0&lt;/code&gt; e a enviam para o repositório.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;quarto-passo-envie-para-o-pkggo&#34;&gt;Quarto passo: envie para o Pkg.Go&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;GOPROXY&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;proxy.golang.org go list -m github.com/linuxsoares/valid-brazilian-cnpj@v0.1.1
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Explicando o comando:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;GOPROXY=proxy.golang.org&lt;/code&gt;: é a URL do Pkg.Go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;code&gt;go list -m github.com/linuxsoares/valid-brazilian-cnpj@v0.1.1&lt;/code&gt;: este comando envia a biblioteca para o Pkg.Go&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depois de rodar esse comando, você já pode acessar a biblioteca no Pkg.Go.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h1 id=&#34;conclusão&#34;&gt;Conclusão&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neste post, mostrei como publicar sua biblioteca no Pkg.Go.
É um processo simples, mas é importante seguir os passos para garantir que tudo funcione como esperado.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Espero que você tenha gostado deste post, e até o próximo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bons códigos!&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Duck Typing em Go</title>
      <link>https://gilsoares.dev/blog/pt/posts/duck-typing-in-go/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 10 Oct 2024 13:46:16 -0300</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://gilsoares.dev/blog/pt/posts/duck-typing-in-go/</guid>
      
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Olá, pessoal!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Como contei em um post anterior, estou aprendendo Go para usar em alguns projetos do trabalho.
Neste post curto, vou explicar como usar duck typing em Go,
algo que foi bem desafiador para mim quando comecei a aprender a linguagem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Para começar, vamos ver um exemplo simples em Python:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-python&#34; data-lang=&#34;python&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nc&#34;&gt;Duck&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;quack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;bp&#34;&gt;self&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;        &lt;span class=&#34;nb&#34;&gt;print&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s2&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Quack, quack!&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;class&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nc&#34;&gt;Person&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;Duck&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;pass&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;quack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;obj&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;obj&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;quack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;k&#34;&gt;def&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;():&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;donald&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;Duck&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;john&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;Person&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;quack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;donald&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;--&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;Quack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;quack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;    &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;quack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;john&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;--&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;Quack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;n&#34;&gt;quack&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;err&#34;&gt;!&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Neste exemplo um pouco excêntrico, a classe Person consegue &amp;ldquo;grasnar&amp;rdquo; como um Duck porque herda da classe Duck.
Em Python, não precisamos declarar explicitamente o tipo do objeto na função; simplesmente chamamos o método que queremos usar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agora, vamos ver como fazer algo parecido em Go:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-go&#34; data-lang=&#34;go&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kn&#34;&gt;package&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kn&#34;&gt;import&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;fmt&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Dog&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;interface&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;Bark&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Cat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;interface&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;Meow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Shihtzu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;struct&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kt&#34;&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;type&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Chartreux&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;struct&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kt&#34;&gt;string&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;func&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Shihtzu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;Bark&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;message&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;Sprintf&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Type: %T - My name is %s! Bark! Bark! Bark!&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;s&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;message&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;func&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Chartreux&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;Meow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;message&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;:=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;Sprintf&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Type: %T - My name is %s! Meow! Meow! Meow! &amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;c&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;fmt&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;Println&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;message&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;func&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;main&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;dog&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Dog&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;dog&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Shihtzu&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Puppy&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;dog&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;Bark&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;kd&#34;&gt;var&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;cat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Cat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;cat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Chartreux&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;{&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;Name&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt; &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;s&#34;&gt;&amp;#34;Kitty&amp;#34;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;	&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nx&#34;&gt;cat&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;nf&#34;&gt;Meow&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;()&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;p&#34;&gt;}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;w&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;O código de exemplo acima está neste &lt;a href=&#34;https://github.com/linuxsoares/go-interfaces&#34;&gt;repositório&lt;/a&gt; no GitHub.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Neste exemplo em Go, temos duas interfaces, Dog e Cat, e duas structs, Shihtzu e Chartreux.
A interface Dog define um método Bark, enquanto a interface Cat define um método Meow.
As structs Shihtzu e Chartreux implementam os métodos Bark e Meow, respectivamente.
É importante notar que, embora isso não esteja escrito explicitamente no código, essas structs estão implementando as interfaces.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Em Go, implementamos uma interface simplesmente definindo os métodos exigidos, sem precisar declarar que a struct implementa explicitamente a interface.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Em outras palavras, não precisamos dizer que Shihtzu é um Dog; basta implementar o método Bark para a struct Shihtzu,
e o Go entende automaticamente que Shihtzu satisfaz a interface Dog.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Isso é bem diferente de linguagens como Python ou Java, mas, quando você pega o jeito,
é direto e fácil de usar.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Espero que este post ajude você a entender melhor o Go e como o duck typing funciona na linguagem!&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Como Estou Aprendendo Golang</title>
      <link>https://gilsoares.dev/blog/pt/posts/how-am-i-learning-golang/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 23 Sep 2024 17:34:27 -0300</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://gilsoares.dev/blog/pt/posts/how-am-i-learning-golang/</guid>
      
      <description>&lt;p&gt;No meu trabalho, comecei a usar Golang. Conheço ferramentas de IA como o ChatGPT, que podem me ajudar a concluir tarefas com mais eficiência.
Mas eu gosto muito de aprender tecnologias novas e estou sempre aberto a novos desafios.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;No passado, aprendi &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.scala-lang.org/&#34;&gt;Scala&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.python.org/&#34;&gt;Python&lt;/a&gt; e &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.java.com/&#34;&gt;Java&lt;/a&gt; lendo livros e praticando todos os dias.
Desta vez, estou aprendendo Golang de outras formas. Uso o Exercism para praticar Golang, e agora vou mostrar como usá-lo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;passo-1-instale-o-golang&#34;&gt;Passo 1: instale o Golang&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Primeiro, você precisa instalar o Golang no seu computador. Dá para baixar pelo site oficial.
Não vou entrar em detalhes sobre a instalação, porque é bem simples.
As instruções de instalação estão &lt;a href=&#34;https://go.dev/&#34;&gt;aqui&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Com o Golang instalado, confira se a instalação deu certo rodando este comando:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;go version
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;passo-2-instale-o-exercism&#34;&gt;Passo 2: instale o Exercism&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Agora que o Golang está instalado, vamos instalar o Exercism.
As instruções de instalação para o seu sistema operacional estão &lt;a href=&#34;https://exercism.org/cli-walkthrough&#34;&gt;nesta página&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depois de instalar o Exercism, confira a instalação rodando:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;exercism version
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2 id=&#34;passo-3-comece-a-praticar&#34;&gt;Passo 3: comece a praticar&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Com tudo configurado, você já pode praticar Golang com o Exercism.
Baixe exercícios com o seguinte comando:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;exercism download --exercise&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&amp;lt;exercise-name&amp;gt; --track&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;go
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Por exemplo:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;exercism download --track&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;go --exercise&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;lasagna-master
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Esse comando baixa o exercício &lt;code&gt;lasagna-master&lt;/code&gt; da trilha de Golang.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Depois de resolver o exercício, envie sua solução com:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;exercism submit
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Isso envia sua solução para o Exercism, e você também pode ver as soluções de outras pessoas.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;conclusão&#34;&gt;Conclusão&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;É assim que estou aprendendo Golang com o Exercism. É uma ótima plataforma para praticar programação em várias linguagens.
Que tal resolver alguns exercícios em Golang ou na linguagem que você preferir? Espero que você aproveite o processo!&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
      
    </item>
    
    <item>
      <title>Primeiro Projeto em Clojure</title>
      <link>https://gilsoares.dev/blog/pt/posts/first-clojure-project/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 16 Sep 2024 18:04:37 -0300</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://gilsoares.dev/blog/pt/posts/first-clojure-project/</guid>
      
      <description>&lt;h1 id=&#34;criando-nosso-primeiro-projeto-clojure&#34;&gt;Criando nosso primeiro projeto Clojure&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vamos continuar nosso tutorial. Hoje vou explicar como criar um projeto Clojure. Decidi dividir este artigo em duas partes: vamos ver como criar um projeto comum e um projeto web, em que vamos criar uma API para algum serviço.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vamos começar criando um projeto comum. Não vai ser uma API, uma biblioteca nem nada do tipo. Só quero mostrar como criar um projeto, explicar sua estrutura e todo o resto.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Criar um projeto é muito simples se você instalou o Leiningen [comentei sobre ele no nosso primeiro artigo]. Se ainda não instalou, faça um favor a si mesmo e instale. O link do projeto está aqui:
&lt;a href=&#34;https://leiningen.org&#34;&gt;Leiningen&lt;/a&gt; — :)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Bom, se você fez esse favor a si mesmo e está com tudo bem instalado, é hora de criar o projeto Clojure. Vamos lá:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;➜ hello-clojure git:&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;master&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; ✗ lein new hello-clojure
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Ao rodar o comando acima, você ganha um diretório chamado hello-clojure, porque esse é o nome do projeto que passamos como parâmetro para o comando new do lein.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;➜ creating-clojure-project git:&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;master&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; ✗ ls
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;hello-clojure
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;A estrutura de um projeto Clojure&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Entrando no diretório, você vai encontrar uma estrutura com muitos arquivos e subdiretórios. Não se assuste nem abandone o artigo; vou explicar cada um deles em detalhes.
Esta é a estrutura do projeto:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vamos explicar cada arquivo e diretório, de cima para baixo:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;doc: na pasta doc, você pode colocar a documentação do seu projeto. O arquivo intro.md vem por padrão quando criamos o projeto com o lein.
    Só para esclarecer, a extensão .md é de markdown, muito usado pelo GitHub, por exemplo.

resources: o diretório resources é usado para guardar qualquer arquivo de configuração de que você precise.

src: dentro de src é onde vamos guardar o código Clojure do projeto.

test: o nome já diz tudo, contém todos os arquivos de teste do projeto.

CHANGELOG: normalmente é onde registramos o que muda em cada versão do projeto, seja em Python, Java, Clojure ou Ruby.

LICENSE: contém as informações legais em que normalmente clicamos &amp;quot;ACEITO&amp;quot; sem ler.

project.clj: enquanto resources é usado para arquivos de configuração, o project.clj é onde de fato configuramos nosso projeto Clojure.
&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Para você não ficar com um projeto que não roda nem mostra o famoso &amp;ldquo;HELLO WORLD&amp;rdquo;, vou explicar como colocá-lo para funcionar. — :)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Abra o arquivo project.clj e adicione o código abaixo depois de :dependencies. Não esqueça que ele precisa ficar dentro dos parênteses.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-clojure&#34; data-lang=&#34;clojure&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;ss&#34;&gt;:main&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class=&#34;nv&#34;&gt;hello-clojure.core/foo&lt;/span&gt;
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;Depois disso, podemos rodar o projeto pela linha de comando, dentro do diretório do projeto, e ver o resultado:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&#34;highlight&#34;&gt;&lt;pre tabindex=&#34;0&#34; class=&#34;chroma&#34;&gt;&lt;code class=&#34;language-bash&#34; data-lang=&#34;bash&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;➜ hello-clojure git:&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;(&lt;/span&gt;master&lt;span class=&#34;o&#34;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt; ✗ lein run Clojure
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;line&#34;&gt;&lt;span class=&#34;cl&#34;&gt;Clojure Hello, World!
&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;E aqui está nosso resultado, sem erros :)&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Para este artigo não ficar longo demais, vou dividi-lo em partes.
Esta parte é sobre criar o projeto, e outra vai tratar do uso de namespaces, de como importá-los em outros namespaces e assim por diante.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;O código vai estar disponível no GitHub, e vamos atualizá-lo a cada artigo.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Por hoje é isso. Obrigado a todos que leram até aqui e pelo ótimo feedback!!!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Abaixo estão os outros artigos e os que vêm por aí:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;pre&gt;&lt;code&gt;Hello World;
